BatteryManager hands the battery data (SRAM, RTC) to an IBatterySaver when one is set, instead of
writing the file itself, so the Android host can write it safely (to a temporary file that then
replaces the save) and while the game runs. emucore/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt applies this patch
to copies of the files at build time; the submodule itself stays unchanged.

